				<SPAN class=MainHeading style="display:inline;width:460px; height:21px">Privacy Statement</SPAN><SPAN class=Copyright style="padding-top:6px;padding-right:25px;display:inline;width:110px;HEIGHT:21px;cursor:hand;BACKGROUND-IMAGE:url('Images/PrintArrow.gif')" onclick="window.print()">Print this page</SPAN>
				<P>
					This Privacy Statement outlines how Oxiana Limited (‘Oxiana’) collects, uses and manages information obtained from visitors to the Oxiana website.
				</P>
				<P>
					Oxiana views the personal privacy of visitors of the website as an important issue, and is committed to maintaining the security of personal information provided to Oxiana by users accessing oxiana.com.au.
				</P>
				<P>
					Oxiana provides links to other websites from hyperlinks within oxiana.com.au. Oxiana’s privacy policy does not cover these external websites.
				</P>
				<P class=SubHeading>
					What Information do we collect?
				</P>
				<P>
					Oxiana collects the following information:
				</P>
				<UL>
					<LI>For statistical purposes we collect information regarding: domain name and information regarding what pages have been accessed.<BR><BR>
					<LI>For the purpose of responding to email requests sent via our website, to send out latest announcements via email, to people who have requested to be added to our mailing list, we collect the following information: name, email address, interest in Oxiana.<BR><BR>
					<LI>For the purpose of responding to other requests for information sent via our website we collect name, email address, interest in Oxiana and the details of the particular request for information.
				</UL>
				<P>
					<SPAN class=SubHeading>Mailing List Subscription</SPAN><BR>
					Oxiana offers a service to send out latest announcements released by Oxiana to interested persons. Information collected for this purpose from our subscribe function is used purely for the purpose of notifying subscribers of recent announcements released by Oxiana.
				</P>
				<P>
					<SPAN class=SubHeading>Privacy Statement Questions</SPAN><BR>
					If you have any questions or you believe Oxiana has not adhered to this Privacy Statement, please contact <A href="ContactUs.html">Oxiana</A>.
				</P>
				<P>
